@startuml
' Cross-cloud composition C4 container diagram spanning aws, azure, and gcp.
' Provider-neutral core rules apply: one start/end directive pair, no
' preprocessor directives, at most 12 nodes, every cross-provider edge labeled,
' special-character node names double-quoted, versioned title, Legend block.
' Each provider is named, colored with its brand hex, and its Boundary and
' Network Boundary are rendered as nested rectangle group containers.

title cross-cloud agent-platform — acme-multicloud / multi-region | 2026-09-22 | v1

' ---- AWS provider (brand #232F3E) -------------------------------------------
' Boundary container = AWS Account; Network Boundary container = AWS VPC.
rectangle "AWS Account 111111111111" as aws_account #232F3E {
  rectangle "AWS VPC vpc-edge" as aws_vpc #232F3E {
    rectangle "edge-gateway" as edge_gateway #232F3E
    rectangle "auth-lambda" as auth_lambda #232F3E
  }
}

' ---- Azure provider (brand #0078D4) -----------------------------------------
' Boundary container = Azure Subscription; Network Boundary container = VNet.
rectangle "Azure Subscription sub-acme" as azure_sub #0078D4 {
  rectangle "Azure VNet vnet-core" as azure_vnet #0078D4 {
    rectangle "openai-service" as openai_service #0078D4
    rectangle "service-bus" as service_bus #0078D4
  }
}

' ---- GCP provider (brand #4285F4) -------------------------------------------
' Boundary container = GCP Project; Network Boundary container = VPC.
rectangle "GCP Project acme-data" as gcp_project #4285F4 {
  rectangle "GCP VPC vpc-data" as gcp_vpc #4285F4 {
    rectangle "vertex-ai" as vertex_ai #4285F4
    rectangle "cloud-storage" as cloud_storage #4285F4
  }
}

' ---- Cross-provider edges (every edge labeled with the data flow) -----------
edge_gateway --> auth_lambda : validate JWT
auth_lambda --> openai_service : forward RAG prompt (AWS to Azure)
openai_service --> service_bus : publish completion event
service_bus --> vertex_ai : stream embeddings (Azure to GCP)
vertex_ai --> cloud_storage : persist model artifacts
cloud_storage --> edge_gateway : return signed artifact URL (GCP to AWS)

legend right
  Solid line = primary flow
  Dashed line = asynchronous / event-driven flow
  Red = blocked / missing / disabled
  New in version N = marked with new marker
  Changed in version N = marked with changed marker
  Dashed outer boundary = stack Boundary (profile brand color)
  Dashed inner boundary = Network Boundary (profile brand color)
  AWS = brand #232F3E ; Azure = brand #0078D4 ; GCP = brand #4285F4
endlegend
@enduml
